            "review_title": "Review at Bo To Quan Moc 29 Thai Phien",
            "review_text": "debbie m\nPerth, Australia35 contributions\n0\nDinner with uninvited quests\nApr 2019 • Couples\nIt is not often I have call to write a bad review, however if you are a European. Visiting this returant I would advise you to keep walking. I should have realised at our frosty welcome that they do not get many European quests, however we were shown to a corner table at the very top of the restaurant 3 floors were I could only assume the staff were eating. The table was hastily cleared and a menus brought. Language barrier was a real issue but we tried our best and ordered from Pictures....... Then the fun began no sooner had our bowls been brought to the table but six large rats appeared from the planters and decided to join us for dinner. Staff did not seem at all bothered by our discomfort actually laughing at one point. As for the food( didn’t eat any) .\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten April 15, 2019",
            "rating": 4.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-15",
